&lt;p&gt;The Regional Marketing Associate supports the execution of regional marketing plans across AMER, working with all Regional Marketing Managers to deliver programs based on team priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own assigned programs and tasks from setup through post-event reporting, using established playbooks, processes, and templates. Your manager will set priorities in partnership with the Regional Marketing Managers. You will be responsible for delivering accurate, high-quality work on time, asking for guidance when needed, and flagging risks early.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will use AI and data tools daily to improve efficiency and inform your work, while remaining accountable for the accuracy and quality of everything you deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute programs across AMER.&lt;/strong&gt; Support all Regional Marketing Managers by delivering assigned events, campaigns and ABM activities using established playbooks, from setup through follow-up. Your manager will set priorities in partnership with the Regional Marketing Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage program operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Build registration pages, emails, landing pages and campaign workflows in the team’s tools. Coordinate paid social execution, vendors and logistics as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure quality before launch.&lt;/strong&gt; Review event setup, assets, emails and landing pages for accuracy, completeness and functionality before they go live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Report on results.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate program data, track agreed metrics and prepare post-event and campaign reports using standard tools and templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep the team informed.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain timelines and task status in Monday.com, and proactively communicate progress and changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support budget operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Track program expenses, manage purchase orders and coordinate invoices with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI and improve processes.&lt;/strong&gt; Apply AI and data tools daily to work more efficiently, validate outputs and share useful workflows and process improvements with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flag issues early.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring risks, blockers, unclear requirements and competing requests to your manager early so priorities and next steps can be resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
