&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Vice President, Enterprise&lt;/strong&gt; who will be responsible for supporting a team of Regional Directors who lead our Enterprise teams. As the RVP you will be asked to drive revenue growth, actively coach existing reps, and attract new talent. The RVP holds ultimate responsibility for the region&#39;s success, reputation &amp;amp; culture - this senior leader should be experienced in cross-functional engagement and have a natural interest in partnering with other GTM, G&amp;amp;A, and R&amp;amp;D leaders - ensuring alignment of the region&#39;s success with North America &amp;amp; company goals, alike.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
