&lt;p&gt;In the United States, the Base compensation range for this role is USD &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;208,602&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;- USD &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;250,322&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed in the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
