&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built or published a Grafana plugin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked on a marketplace, app store or package registry, or on billing and licensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built developer tooling such as CLIs, SDKs or CI pipelines used by other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience working with a Product Manager or external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
