&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote opportunity and we&#39;re interested in candidates based in the US or Canada. Residents of Quebec are not eligible for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer, Grafana Data Source Plugins&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Full-Stack Engineer in the Grafana Data Source Plugins squad, you will take a leading role in developing and enhancing a diverse portfolio of data source plugins that retrieve the data powering Grafana dashboards used by teams worldwide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team focuses on continuously improving data source plugins, ensuring seamless experience for human and agent users alike. A key aspect of this role is guaranteeing the smooth operation and reliability of our plugins in the Grafana Cloud, helping us deliver on our commitment to world-class observability tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some data source plugins we own:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prometheus, Loki, Infinity, MySQL, PostgreSQL, AWS Cloudwatch, and Clickhouse.&amp;nbsp; The full catalog is listed &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/grafana/plugins/search/?type=datasource&amp;amp;publisher=grafana&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A typical “day in the life” could include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building or improving Grafana plugins to integrate third party services or databases into Grafana&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the operations and reliability of our plugins in Grafana Cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coming up with suggestions for process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrating data sources with agentic workflows such as Grafana Assistant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing technical support in customer escalations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with the rest of the Grafana Division&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to transform ideas into working code, you are able to design a solution, get feedback and deliver large projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-driven individual who understands the power of feedback loops in making roadmap decisions and driving our product forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a motivated self starter with a bias towards action, and willing to take on any challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are customer focused. We build everything with our users in mind. You have a passion for creating intuitive products that fit customers’ needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent communicator and you enjoy collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working in a remote-first company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Golang &amp;amp; Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes &amp;amp; microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing clean, robust, and performant software that is easily maintained by others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience participating in an on-call rotation and performing operations/SRE tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have been a user of Grafana and Grafana Data Sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have expertise in one of the underlying databases we support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience working with a Product Manager or external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
