&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Working with the team to enhance documentation, write blog posts, record videos, contribute knowledge base articles and create other public or private enablement material&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
