&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be open to various and complex assignments, this will require strong judgment, collaboration, and leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
